          "status": "machine-unreviewed",
          "text": "Description: On July 12, 2014, a witness observed from their balcony the slow group movement of four blue circles. They began to flash and left together, maintaining an equal distance from each other. Given the objective elements defined in the investigation report (see attached document), the hypothesis of a festive event without confirmation possibility makes the strangeness of the phenomenon average to low. The testimony is of average consistency: imprecision regarding movement, absence of pattern. The GEIPAN classifies this case as 'C' due to lack of information or cross-references.",
